      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "特别周正是沿着这条路线前进、\n并赢下了整个比赛界人士梦寐以求的\n『日本德比』。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd78f4589e4a37e3fdb157e8a9d51134a3644151a812aca9f8055d2233ad4fec",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
